{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Archimedean.RSK","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Archimedean.RSK","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.List.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.List.Sort","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Finset.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":33,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.RSK.rskBurnside_refl","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.RSK.rskBurnside_refl","kind":"instance","line":263,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/RSK.lean#L263-L265","doc":"Reflexivity instance for `RSKBurnside`: when `sumDimSq` and\n`factorial` are syntactically the same value, the class holds. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.RSK.RSKBurnside.identity","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.RSK.RSKBurnside.identity","kind":"theorem","line":261,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/RSK.lean#L261-L261","doc":"Sum of dim² equals k!. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.RSK.RSKBurnside.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.RSK.RSKBurnside.mk","kind":"ctor","line":259,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/RSK.lean#L259-L259","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.RSK.RSKBurnside","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.RSK.RSKBurnside","kind":"class","line":255,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/RSK.lean#L255-L261","doc":"**RSK Burnside identity — typeclass.**\nPer-`k` witness that `Σ_{λ ⊢ k} dim(λ)² = k!`. Follows from\nRSK bijectivity once the previous two classes are inhabited. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.RSK.RSKSurjective.right_inverse","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.RSK.RSKSurjective.right_inverse","kind":"theorem","line":253,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/RSK.lean#L253-L253","doc":"`rsk ∘ rsk_inv = id` on the image. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.RSK.RSKSurjective.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.RSK.RSKSurjective.mk","kind":"ctor","line":250,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/RSK.lean#L250-L250","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.RSK.RSKSurjective","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.RSK.RSKSurjective","kind":"class","line":245,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/RSK.lean#L245-L253","doc":"**RSK surjectivity — typeclass.**\nPer-`(rsk, rsk_inv)` witness that the RSK map has a right\ninverse on pairs `(P, Q)` of standard Young tableaux of the\nsame shape. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.RSK.RSKInjective.left_inverse","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.RSK.RSKInjective.left_inverse","kind":"theorem","line":243,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/RSK.lean#L243-L243","doc":"`rsk_inv ∘ rsk = id`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.RSK.RSKInjective.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.RSK.RSKInjective.mk","kind":"ctor","line":240,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/RSK.lean#L240-L240","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.RSK.RSKInjective","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.RSK.RSKInjective","kind":"class","line":236,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/RSK.lean#L236-L243","doc":"**RSK injectivity — typeclass.**\nPer-`(rsk, rsk_inv)` witness that the RSK map has a left inverse.\nPending implementation of reverse row bumping in Lean. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.RSK.branch_dim_211","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.RSK.branch_dim_211","kind":"theorem","line":232,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/RSK.lean#L232-L232","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.RSK.branch_dim_22","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.RSK.branch_dim_22","kind":"theorem","line":231,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/RSK.lean#L231-L231","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.RSK.branch_dim_31","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.RSK.branch_dim_31","kind":"theorem","line":228,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/RSK.lean#L228-L230","doc":"Classical branching identity: Σ m_μ × dim(μ) = dim(λ).\nConcrete for (3,1): 1×1 + 1×2 + 0×1 = 3. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.RSK.fomin_k5_std","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.RSK.fomin_k5_std","kind":"theorem","line":224,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/RSK.lean#L224-L226","doc":"Fomin at k=5, μ=(2,1): dims 1,4,5,6,5,4,1. mults 0,1,2,2,2,1,0. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.RSK.fomin_k4_alt","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.RSK.fomin_k4_alt","kind":"theorem","line":221,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/RSK.lean#L221-L222","doc":"Fomin at k=4, μ=(1,1,1): mults 0,0,0,1,1. sum = 3+1 = 4 = 4·1. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.RSK.fomin_k4_std","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.RSK.fomin_k4_std","kind":"theorem","line":218,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/RSK.lean#L218-L219","doc":"Fomin at k=4, μ=(2,1): mults 0,1,1,1,0. sum = 3+2+3 = 8 = 4·2. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.RSK.fomin_k4_sym","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.RSK.fomin_k4_sym","kind":"theorem","line":214,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/RSK.lean#L214-L216","doc":"Fomin at k=4, μ=(3): Σ dim(λ)·m_{(3)}^λ = 4!/6·1 = 4.\ndims: 1,3,2,3,1. mults: 1,1,0,0,0. sum = 1+3 = 4. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.RSK.burnside_6","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.RSK.burnside_6","kind":"theorem","line":204,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/RSK.lean#L204-L210","doc":"k! = Σ dim(λ)² for k = 6.\nPartitions of 6 with irrep dimensions (hook-length formula):\n(6)→1, (5,1)→5, (4,2)→9, (4,1,1)→10, (3,3)→5, (3,2,1)→16,\n(3,1,1,1)→10, (2,2,2)→5, (2,2,1,1)→9, (2,1,1,1,1)→5, (1⁶)→1. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.RSK.burnside_5","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.RSK.burnside_5","kind":"theorem","line":201,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/RSK.lean#L201-L202","doc":"k! = Σ dim(λ)² for k = 5. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.RSK.burnside_4","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.RSK.burnside_4","kind":"theorem","line":198,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/RSK.lean#L198-L199","doc":"k! = Σ dim(λ)² for k = 4. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.RSK.burnside_3","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.RSK.burnside_3","kind":"theorem","line":195,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/RSK.lean#L195-L196","doc":"k! = Σ dim(λ)² for k = 3. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.RSK.rskRaw","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.RSK.rskRaw","kind":"def","line":186,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/RSK.lean#L186-L191","doc":"The RSK map on raw row data (no invariant proofs). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.RSK.addEntry","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.RSK.addEntry","kind":"def","line":179,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/RSK.lean#L179-L184","doc":"Build recording tableau by adding val at position (r, c). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.RSK.schenstedInsertRows_size","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.RSK.schenstedInsertRows_size","kind":"theorem","line":154,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/RSK.lean#L154-L175","doc":"Schensted insertion adds exactly one cell. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.RSK.schenstedInsertRows","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.RSK.schenstedInsertRows","kind":"def","line":143,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/RSK.lean#L143-L152","doc":"Cascade rowBump through rows. Returns new rows and placement position. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.RSK.rowBump_sorted","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.RSK.rowBump_sorted","kind":"theorem","line":109,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/RSK.lean#L109-L139","doc":"rowBump preserves sortedness (for fresh x ∉ row). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.RSK.rowBump_bumped_gt","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.RSK.rowBump_bumped_gt","kind":"theorem","line":88,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/RSK.lean#L88-L107","doc":"The bumped element (if any) is > x. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.RSK.rowBump_mem","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.RSK.rowBump_mem","kind":"theorem","line":66,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/RSK.lean#L66-L86","doc":"Elements of `(rowBump row x).1` are either from `row` or equal to `x`.\nThis is the key structural lemma: row-bump substitutes at most one element. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.RSK.rowBump_length","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.RSK.rowBump_length","kind":"theorem","line":49,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/RSK.lean#L49-L64","doc":"rowBump preserves length or adds 1. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.RSK.rowBump_ge","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.RSK.rowBump_ge","kind":"theorem","line":42,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/RSK.lean#L42-L47","doc":"rowBump when x ≥ head. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.RSK.rowBump_lt","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.RSK.rowBump_lt","kind":"theorem","line":37,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/RSK.lean#L37-L40","doc":"rowBump when x < head. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.RSK.rowBump_nil","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.RSK.rowBump_nil","kind":"theorem","line":34,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/RSK.lean#L34-L35","doc":"rowBump on empty list. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.RSK.rowBump","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.RSK.rowBump","kind":"def","line":22,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/RSK.lean#L22-L32","doc":"Row bump: insert x into a strictly sorted list.\nInductive on the list, replacing the first element > x.\nReturns (new_row, bumped_element_or_none). ","signatureChunk":0}]}